senses.gloss:
--generally a war-musical instrument; employed on auspicious occasions, and in temples;
1: भा. I. ११. १८; M. १४९. 2; १६३. १०५; १९२. २८.
sounding of bugles in a wrestling match;
2: Vi. V. २०. ३०.
finding चाणूर declining, Kamsa stop- ped the sounding of the drum when the Devas sounded divine music.
3: Vi. V. २०. ७१-3.
